//! [`ColorPrimariesDescriptorRef`] or [`ColorPrimariesDescriptorMut`], the
//! white point as a [`CieXyRef`] or [`CieXyMut`] and the primaries as a
//! [`PrimaryCoefficientsRef`] or [`PrimaryCoefficientsMut`] over their own.
